[40.454146, "o", "\u001b[32m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mStatus, topics, shared papers, named labs and systems, conditional bounds, gap verdicts,\u001b[0m \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mrelated problems and the concept hierarchy, all answered as graph traversals over\u001b[0m        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mone pinned catalog commit. Every row leads back to the page it was read from.\u001b[0m            \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[40.455266, "o", "  \u001b[2mLabs, systems, models, gap verdicts and the concept hierarchy are our classifications\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  of the catalog's words; RELATED_TO is computed. Authors are kept as written.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
